# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GeoShield AI — environment configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app runs in TWO modes:
#
#   1. In-memory demo mode (DEFAULT) — no database needed. Just run:
#        npm run dev
#      and everything works out of the box with the bundled dataset.
#
#   2. PostgreSQL mode — for persistent storage. Copy this file to `.env`,
#      set a real connection string, and run `npx drizzle-kit push` once:
#
#        DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/app_db
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app_db
